<li id="main-traits_race_dwarf-fake-fn-6-target"><p><Link to="/source/advanced_players_guide">Advanced Player's Guide</Link> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 6" id="backlink-main-traits_race_dwarf-fake-fn-6" data-hash-target to="main-traits_race_dwarf-fake-fn-6">↩</InnerLink> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 6" id="backlink-main-traits_race_dwarf-fake-fn-6.2" data-hash-target to="main-traits_race_dwarf-fake-fn-6.2">↩<sup>2</sup></InnerLink></p></li>
