<li id="main-traits_race_half_elf-fake-fn-8-target"><p><Link to="/source/heroes_of_the_wild">Heroes of the Wild</Link> <InnerLink aria-label="Back to reference 8" id="backlink-main-traits_race_half_elf-fake-fn-8" data-hash-target to="main-traits_race_half_elf-fake-fn-8">↩</InnerLink></p></li>
