<Pair single id="traitbitterheart-bitter-heart-fn1"><Link to="/trait/bitter_heart">⮞</Link> Bitter Heart <sup><InnerLink showBacklink="backlink-main-traits_race_changeling-fake-fn-1" id="main-traits_race_changeling-fake-fn-1" data-hash-target to="main-traits_race_changeling-fake-fn-1-target">1</InnerLink></sup></Pair>
